{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"98495","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/98495","key":"MC-156663","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"13/Jul/19 6:23 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug </h3>\n\n<p>I have already seen the \"fixed\" bug report \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-151333\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-151333\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"AI/Pathfinding issues with Villagers\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-151333\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n but the villagers still get stuck in the water. I have been trying to make a swamp village in a part of swampland that has no exposed land anywhere but the villagers keep jumping in the water and once they do they just swim in it.</p>\n\n<p>I have found that the pathfinding is broken in where they still swim in the water but they can't seem to detect a bed where they need to swim out of the water and then onto land to get to it. As soon as I push the villager onto land he goes to the bed.</p>\n\n<p>In the picture below a villager is in the water right beside a bed at night but isn't going into it.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n\n<p>See @<a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=Gintoki\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Gintoki</a> in this <a href=\"#comment-645022\" rel=\"noreferrer\">comment</a> and this <a href=\"https://youtu.be/iaydB_oyMjI\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">video</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Apr/20 12:57 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/129109","id":"129109","filename":"2019-07-13_09.20.30.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"AquaticAmps64","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"customer"},"created":"13/Jul/19 6:21 AM","size":"1.73 MB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/129109","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/129109"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/129110","id":"129110","filename":"2020-03-09_12.45.58.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us